{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Reflect on Completion",
  "description": "After the agent finishes a conversation about building a container, reflect on the overall experience and update documentation and lessons learned with any general improvements.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "agentStop"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Before finishing, check if this conversation involved building or modifying a container for a Cradlepoint NCOS router. If it did:\n\n1. Review what you learned during this session\n2. Check if `.kiro/steering/lessons-learned.md` needs updates with general-purpose lessons\n3. Check if any `docs/` files have inaccuracies that should be corrected\n4. Check if `.kiro/steering/container-building.md` workflow needs refinement\n\nOnly make updates if there are genuine general-purpose improvements to record. Do not add project-specific details. If nothing new was learned, skip updates."
  }
}